+### `host/*`
+
+<a id="hosttool-effect--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `host/tool-effect` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/**
+ * Host-owned effect class recorded when a tool body is entered.
+ * A started call without this record is missing evidence. The class is not
+ * derived from model text or concurrency-safe metadata.
+ */
+'host/tool-effect': {
+  /** Model call id or nested sub-call id this record classifies. */
+  callId: string
+  /** Tool name dispatched. */
+  name: string
+  /** Trusted host classification of that dispatch. */
+  effect: 'read-only' | 'filesystem-write' | 'external-write' | 'unknown'
+  /** True when the dispatch is nested under another tool execution. */
+  nested: boolean
+}
+```
+
