 ### `session/*`
 
+<a id="sessionactive-branch--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `session/active-branch` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/**
+ * Authoritative active-branch decision for one human prompt. Reconstruction
+ * keeps the effective prefix through `anchorSeq`, replaces that prompt with
+ * `prompt`, and omits every later event before this decision, including
+ * later admitted human prompts. Required for reconstruction: skipping it
+ * would present the superseded attempt as current.
+ */
+'session/active-branch': {
+  /** Monotonic branch revision. The implicit original branch is revision 0. */
+  revision: number
+  /** Sequence of the human prompt this decision replaces. */
+  anchorSeq: SessionSeq
+  /** Stable message id of that prompt. */
+  messageId: string
+  /** Idempotency key. A repeated key must carry the same payload. */
+  requestId: string
+  /** Branch revision the caller observed before this decision. */
+  expectedRevision: number
+  /**
+   * Opaque token for admitted human input and the pending queue at admission.
+   * Assistant stream progress is not part of the token.
+   */
+  inputRevision: string
+  /**
+   * Exact replacement text. Absent means the original prompt text is kept
+   * and non-text attachments stay on `prompt` either way.
+   */
+  text?: string
+  /** Exact prompt admitted by this decision, including preserved attachments. */
+  prompt: UserMessage
+}
+```
