+<a id="user-message-actions"></a>
+## User message actions
+
+Durable user prompts and admitted steering messages expose the session-scoped list `conversation.chat.user-actions`. Each entry receives `messageId` and `text`. `messageId` is the durable prompt id: a user row passes the Context id preserved from the `user/message` event, and an admitted steering row passes `data.messageId`. `text` is the plain text joined for the copy action. Pending steering, local submission echoes, injected context, and non-human turn triggers do not render the list. With no entries, the copy control and clock stay unchanged.
