@@ -0,0 +1,60 @@
+---
+description: "Records a persistence type transition and its compatibility acknowledgement."
+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-10-07-session-format-v5
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-07-session-format-v5.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+The session writer is format 5. The header may record classification and ownedDirectory. session/active-branch records one logical prompt replacement on the same session. host/tool-effect records the trusted effect class of a tool dispatch that has started.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-07-session-format-v5
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "JsonlHeaderLine"
+    previous: "2026-09-11-initial"
+    after: "a0fdfd10965afc6f1f9ef13d0c311530ee7292af19b3ee1e510499b514953268"
+    decision: version-bump
+  - root: "SessionHeader"
+    previous: "2026-09-16-session-format-v4"
+    after: "b0e6db5ae7073c0db7f122408053a73f5ff20bd3038652b053ba7184691a3a78"
+    decision: version-bump
+  - root: "event:host/tool-effect"
+    previous: null
+    after: "422d4bf501a678bf89f24f4253289bb9cfcc8ba58385b5dcd04391260b7b2a40"
+    decision: version-bump
+  - root: "event:session/active-branch"
+    previous: null
+    after: "ee5bae351c7fadf45b68e4937ebf5b445fdd7bf3fc48d4310ac90fa751c785fe"
+    decision: version-bump
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+A format 4 reader rejects a version 5 log. The adjacent migration reads a version 4 log and writes version 5, and the accepted version 4 schema is unchanged. classification and ownedDirectory may be absent. A reader that does not know session/active-branch or host/tool-effect refuses the log unless that event is ignorable.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+Lifecycle tests resume a version 5 free-session log. A cold restart after a durable turn start and before any assistant result performs one replacement model call. A durable assistant result suppresses another call. A write tool without a durable result remains interrupted and is not replayed.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
