+
+# Session V4 persistence format
+
+English | [中文](v4.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Inspect the V4 persistence types captured from the `dsh-v0.2.0-rc.2` writer before active-branch reconstruction. Tool results are flat tool-role messages, and the header has no session classification or owned-directory field. This snapshot preserves that declared inventory.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Source evidence](#evidence)
+- [Format characteristics](#characteristics)
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Complete schemas](#schema)
+- [Verification and limitations](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+-----
+
+<a id="evidence"></a>
+## Source evidence
+
+The source is product tag `dsh-v0.2.0-rc.2`. The archive command captured the current inventory while `SESSION_FORMAT_VERSION` was still 4, before active-branch events and session classification. The [release-status reference](../../session-format-status.md) still records the latest published format separately. This page is the historical V4 inventory, not the current catalog.
+
+The extracted declarations come from `packages/core/session/src/types.ts`, `packages/session/session-persistence-jsonl/src/format.ts`, and every first-party `SessionEventMap` merge reachable at that writer. Source paths refer to that tree, without line numbers.
+
+<a id="characteristics"></a>
+## Format characteristics
+
+These facts describe the selected checkpoint.
+
+- `SessionHeader.version` resolves to the literal 4. Logical and physical headers require `isSeeded`. Classification and owned-directory fields are absent.
+- Message-producing events require `surfaceOp`. Replacement endpoints are `startSeq` and `endSeq`.
+- Tool results are tool-role messages. Active-branch decisions and host tool-effect records are not part of this inventory.
+
